{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/49646-let-s-talk-about-sex-again","id":49646,"title":"Let's Talk About Sex (Again!)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-15T02:31:49-08:00","id":49646,"title":"Let's Talk About Sex (Again!)","content":"I was surprised that no one had brought this thread back yet. Well, I'm fixing that.<br /> <br /> \u200bMy sex-life is currently at a standstill, but I did have an interesting experience this afternoon.<br /> <br /> I recently started playing a solo game of Scion with a friend. My character is a lanky, rather nerdy Hispanic college student living in Seattle, WA. His first real mission as a Scion of Quetzalcoatl was to &quot;look into&quot; a less than reputable Auto body shop. The order (suggestion?) came with very little background information, so I just went there and tried to scope the place out. <br /> <br /> Anyway, I ended up making chitchat with a mechanic who worked at said shop and, due to his misunderstanding my meaning (or perhaps reading too far into what I was saying), he assumed I was coming on to him and invited me into the shop for some &quot;alone time&quot;. I had casually mentioned that my mouth tends to get me in trouble when I have nothing to do. He took this as an offer for impromptu oral sex. <br /> <br /> \u200bOk, so at this point, I had no solid idea of where my character stood, in terms of sexual orientation. What did I do? I rolled a d10 to decide if he was gay, straight or bisexual. Why? I have no clue. Anyway, the dice decided that my Scion was comfortably bisexual, so t figured &quot;why not?&quot; and ended up going down on what turned out to be a Centaur. After that, I was at a loss as to what to do next, but I remembered that the Centaur/mechanic had mentioned he was losing time on his lunch break. <br /> <br /> Long story short: Instead of investigating the place for strange occurrences, I ended up orally pleasuring a Centaur and going on a rather enjoyable lunch-date with him. My Storyteller was amused and completely baffled by my actions. So am I.<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/redface.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Embarrassment\" smilieid=\"2\" class=\"inlineimg\" />\u200b<br /> <br /> \u200bYour turn!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-15T13:33:54-08:00","id":50033,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">I direct posters to the &quot;no threadcrapping&quot; rule (#2). Forum rules are linked in my sig.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.<