"id":337950,"title":"","content":"Any feedback on newest UK porn laws? At the same they banned some stuff I genuinely dislike, but some of their new provisions are moronic, like banning depictions of female ejaculation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-12T10:05:55-08:00","id":338118,"title":"","content":"I'll preface by saying that I've only heard about the law secondhand, not read it myself, but unless some undisclosed detail makes all the difference, my reaction is essentially as most others' have been. The laws seems like an haphazard outbreak of puritanism at best and actively misogynic at worst. The fact that specifically female ejaculation is banned has been jumped on since day one, but the face-sitting ban is also skewed this way. While face-sitting can be performed by either sex, if they were indeed worried about the risk of suffocation, then they should by all right also ban things like deep-throating, cock-gagging or other forms extreme oral sex. It's a very skewed law, gender-wise.<br /> <br /> One must also wonder if the correct message to give is that some sex acts are allowed while others aren't. I'll admit, BDSM and certain other form of sex probably are more accident-prone than other, but the solution isn't to ban BDSM. The solution is to educate about it, so that the dangers can be addressed. By making it forbidden, it only becomes less approachable and alien.<br /> <br /> And good job on homogenizing the porn scene, too. The kind of material the law touches on most is typically not the things that most people watch; it's a sub-genre with a small enthusiast audience. This makes smaller, dedicated studios even less economically sound than previously. I also can't help but this that if good, law-abiding porn studios will no longer make that kind of content, then maybe the production will shift to shadier enterprises, which isn't good for something that, as previously stated, can have bad effects if performed improperly.<br /> <br /> Yeah, I'm not a fan. The law is a scatter shot of moral panic that seems anachronistic and confused. While there are problems of representation in porn, these do not address them. Ditch it, really.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-12T10:23:34-08:00","id":338138,"title":"","content":"There is a difference between BDSM people who don't really do anything dangerous to themselves (even if I don't enjoy such stuff personally) and people who insist sticking needles into clits is safe. The law penalizes the former as well, without seeing any difference between relative reasonable majority and the disturbing minority.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perf