 http://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Courtly_love </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Most specifically, on these particular tenets: <b>Stages of courtly love</b><ul><li>Attraction to the lady, usually via eyes/glance</li> <li>Worship of the lady from afar</li> <li>Declaration of passionate devotion</li> <li>Virtuous rejection by the lady</li> <li>Renewed wooing with oaths of virtue and eternal fealty</li> <li>Moans of approaching death from unsatisfied desire (and other physical manifestations of <u>lovesickness.)</u></li> <li>Heroic deeds of valor which win the lady's favor.</li> </ul>While forgoing these last in respect for the lady's life choices and personal obligations:<ul><li>Consummation of the secret love</li> <li>Endless adventures and subterfuges avoiding detection.</li> </ul><br /> Thoughts?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":380,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","user":"AzraelFirestorm","date":". 12-24-2014, 04:48 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-24T01:39:48-08:00","id":348889,"title":"","content":"What if she doesn't virtuously reject you, and says yes?<br /> <br /> Edit: Also, this is the first time I've posted in this thread, and it was because of something you posted