"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Courtly_love\" target=\"_blank\"> Courtly love - Wikipedia </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Courtly_love\" target=\"_blank\"> http://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Courtly_love </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Thoughts?</div> </div> </div> </div>What I know about relationships would rattle in a very small thimble, so I'm hesitant to offer any firm viewpoints, but my first thought is that it sounds kind of drama-filled, which sounds nice, but I'd <i>imagine</i> would get...wearing after a while? From what very little I understand, a large part of the appeal of relationships is having someone to talk to, and this sort of thing would impact that aspect?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mSW2-p-SwmYw5gaqnVMQ7HcRNhVedC-aA4vB6sBclGk/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for GMs</a> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1hslzrmui6ML-v7LniQUXLNyy8o52YF9g2u6usdu-Drc/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for Players</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/207-allan53","name":"Allan53","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"966"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-24T01:59:13-08:00","id":348892,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prometheus878</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/49646-let-s-talk-about-sex-again?p=348889#post348889\" rel=\"nofollow\" titl