re/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2360-cecoyotl","name":"Cecoyotl","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2360_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"207"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-30T07:24:25-07:00","id":462217,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AzraelFirestorm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/49646-let-s-talk-about-sex-again?p=422723#post422723\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> *fist in the air* Represented!<br /> <br /> Anyhoo...<br /> <br /> <br /> I have a strange mental stew on the brain-stove tonight, but the part that's relevant to the thread is this:<br /> <br /> I forgot how much of my (very dusty. Only slightly used, though.) sex life centered around BDSM. Looking back, I've literally never been in any romantic relationship that didn't include a fair amount of bondage, Sado-masochism or Dominance and Submission play. It was, weirdly, hardly ever discussed. It was just how things went. Huh.<br /> <br /> The thing about it is, I forgot the extent of the play because I find a lot of genuine emotional sincerity in my BDSM play and in people who live the lifestyle. I had just mentally filed all that as Intimacy, without further descriptors. I suppose it's because I find that there's an honesty in wanting to be