akes me ache inside, though. I miss the intimacy that comes with it. Cuddling, falling asleep while holding the one you love, sneaking kisses and just being there. I miss that.</div> </div> </div> </div>I wish I weren't resigned to never overcoming my fear of people, except I don't really wish that because, as I said, I'm resigned. It's not so bad. I've found a pace I can keep up. I'm not recommending it, but I'm saying, it does get to be okay after a while.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-02T12:18:16-07:00","id":649165,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/49646-let-s-talk-about-sex-again?p=648755#post648755\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Nothing. We just really, really, really, really, really like to jizz. Nothing wrong with that. Also nothing wrong with you wanting something a little more than that.<br /> <br /> I wish I weren't resigned to never overcoming my fear of people, except I don't really wish that because, as I said, I'm resigned. It's not so bad. I've found a pace I can keep up. I'm not recommending it, but I'm saying, it does get to be okay after a while.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Firstly, yes we do. I see your point, Jim. PM me for further musings on jizz, jiz