e even while driving, no fucking way in hell i'd leave her alone with my baby if i wasnt near by...my family isnt involved really, and my sister in law last time she watched her for two hours at our place while we went shopping, let her sit in a dirty diaper because even though we reminded her to check it if she started crying she didnt and my poor girl was so upset she cried herself to sleep...<br /> <br /> Theres no such thing at this age of an infants life as &quot;to much control&quot; a baby this young cannot be spoiled, cannot be controlled(fuck they control the parents life, not the other way around), and cannot simply cry in their room alone. They need their parents love and affection they need to KNOW that mommy or daddy will be there for them, to do otherwise leads them to not have trust that their parents can and will care for them. When they cry they have a need, be it hunger, a dirty diaper or simply the need to be cuddled. ALL of these are important to the growth of a babies mental well being to help them be &quot;successful adults&quot;. Forgive me if im not the type of person to drop my 3 month old in her crib and be selfish while she cries so i can have sex. Sorry, but i'm just not that type of person, if my daughter needs me NOTHING else matters. Yes it sucks but thats what adults do.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\"><span style=\"color:#ee82ee\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><i><u>Follow me on twitter! <a href=\"https://twitter.com/scelestai\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/scelestai</a></u></i></b></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta","name":"Scelesta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Po